{"seq":2,"slug":"llm-as-judge","title":"LLM 作为评委","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/llm-evaluation-benchmarks/methods/llm-as-judge","wordCount":1313,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"llm-作为评委\">LLM 作为评委</h1><p>2023 年，Zheng et al. 在论文《Judging LLM-as-a-Judge with MT-Bench and Chatbot Arena》中系统论证了一件 AI 工程师们已经在悄悄做的事：用强大的 LLM（通常是 GPT-4）来评判其他 LLM 的输出质量，替代昂贵的人工评测。这个方法迅速成为行业主流，因为它既比人工评测便宜几个数量级，又比 n-gram 指标更能捕捉语义质量。但&quot;LLM 作为评委&quot;也带来了一套新的偏差和可靠性问题，不了解这些问题就去用，会得到一套看起来漂亮实则误导性十足的分数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LLM 作为评委（LLM-as-Judge）有三种基本范式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Pointwise（单点评分）</strong></td>\n<td>对单个输出打分（1-5 或 1-10）</td>\n<td>有绝对质量标准的任务</td>\n<td>分数 + 理由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Pairwise（成对比较）</strong></td>\n<td>比较 A 和 B 哪个更好</td>\n<td>相对质量判断，无绝对基准</td>\n<td>偏好 + 理由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Reference-Guided（参考引导）</strong></td>\n<td>对照参考答案评判</td>\n<td>有标准答案的任务</td>\n<td>分数 + 偏差点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[待评模型输出] --&gt; B{评委 LLM}&#10;    C[任务/问题] --&gt; B&#10;    D[参考答案(可选)] --&gt; B&#10;    E[评分标准/rubric] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; F[分数/偏好]&#10;    B --&gt; G[评分理由]&#10;    B --&gt; H[具体改进建议]\">graph LR\n    A[待评模型输出] --&gt; B{评委 LLM}\n    C[任务/问题] --&gt; B\n    D[参考答案(可选)] --&gt; B\n    E[评分标准/rubric] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; F[分数/偏好]\n    B --&gt; G[评分理由]\n    B --&gt; H[具体改进建议]</pre><h2 id=\"三种评委范式的详细设计\">三种评委范式的详细设计</h2><h3 id=\"pointwise-评分\">Pointwise 评分</h3><p>Pointwise 范式的关键是 rubric（评分标准）的设计。模糊的 rubric 会放大评委 LLM 本身的偏好；具体的、可操作的 rubric 才能让评分结果稳定可信。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"POINTWISE_PROMPT = &quot;&quot;&quot;你是一个专业的代码质量评委。请对以下代码片段按照标准评分。&#10;&#10;【评分任务】&#10;{task_description}&#10;&#10;【待评代码】&#10;{model_output}&#10;&#10;【评分标准（Rubric）】&#10;5分：代码正确解决问题，无边界情况遗漏，有适当注释，符合语言最佳实践&#10;4分：代码基本正确，有轻微遗漏（如少数边界情况），可维护性良好&#10;3分：代码逻辑正确但有明显改进空间（如缺少错误处理、命名不规范）&#10;2分：代码部分正确，存在逻辑错误或重要边界情况遗漏&#10;1分：代码不能正确解决问题，存在根本性错误&#10;&#10;【输出格式】（JSON）&#10;{{&#10;  &quot;score&quot;: &lt;1-5的整数&gt;,&#10;  &quot;dimension_scores&quot;: {{&#10;    &quot;correctness&quot;: &lt;1-5&gt;,&#10;    &quot;edge_cases&quot;: &lt;1-5&gt;,&#10;    &quot;readability&quot;: &lt;1-5&gt;&#10;  }},&#10;  &quot;rationale&quot;: &quot;&lt;50字以内的主要理由&gt;&quot;,&#10;  &quot;main_issue&quot;: &quot;&lt;最严重的一个问题（若有）&gt;&quot;&#10;}}&#10;&#10;只输出 JSON，不要其他内容。&quot;&quot;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">POINTWISE_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"\"你是一个专业的代码质量评委。请对以下代码片段按照标准评分。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【评分任务】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{task_description}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【待评代码】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{model_output}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【评分标准（Rubric）】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5分：代码正确解决问题，无边界情况遗漏，有适当注释，符合语言最佳实践</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">4分：代码基本正确，有轻微遗漏（如少数边界情况），可维护性良好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3分：代码逻辑正确但有明显改进空间（如缺少错误处理、命名不规范）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2分：代码部分正确，存在逻辑错误或重要边界情况遗漏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1分：代码不能正确解决问题，存在根本性错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【输出格式】（JSON）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"score\": &#x3C;1-5的整数>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"dimension_scores\": </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"correctness\": &#x3C;1-5>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"edge_cases\": &#x3C;1-5>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"readability\": &#x3C;1-5></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  }}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"rationale\": \"&#x3C;50字以内的主要理由>\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"main_issue\": \"&#x3C;最严重的一个问题（若有）>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">只输出 JSON，不要其他内容。\"\"\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Pointwise 的主要陷阱：</strong> 评委对 rubric 中的描述词（&quot;轻微&quot;、&quot;明显&quot;、&quot;良好&quot;）有主观解读，导致分数分布不稳定——通常集中在中间分段（3-4 分），极端分很少出现。可以通过强制要求评委先判断&quot;通过/不通过&quot;，再在通过的里面细分，来减少分数收缩。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pairwise-比较\">Pairwise 比较</h3><p>Pairwise 范式更容易获得稳定的相对顺序，因为比较比打分容易：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"PAIRWISE_PROMPT = &quot;&quot;&quot;你是一个公正的评委。你的任务是比较两个 AI 助手对同一问题的回答，判断哪个更好。&#10;&#10;【问题】&#10;{question}&#10;&#10;【回答 A】&#10;{response_a}&#10;&#10;【回答 B】&#10;{response_b}&#10;&#10;【评判维度】&#10;1. 准确性：回答在事实上是否正确&#10;2. 完整性：是否充分回答了问题的所有方面&#10;3. 清晰度：是否易于理解&#10;4. 有用性：是否切实帮助用户解决了问题&#10;&#10;请公正评判，不要被回答的长度或格式影响判断。&#10;&#10;【输出格式】（JSON）&#10;{{&#10;  &quot;winner&quot;: &quot;A&quot; | &quot;B&quot; | &quot;tie&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dimension_winner&quot;: {{&#10;    &quot;accuracy&quot;: &quot;A&quot; | &quot;B&quot; | &quot;tie&quot;,&#10;    &quot;completeness&quot;: &quot;A&quot; | &quot;B&quot; | &quot;tie&quot;,&#10;    &quot;clarity&quot;: &quot;A&quot; | &quot;B&quot; | &quot;tie&quot;,&#10;    &quot;helpfulness&quot;: &quot;A&quot; | &quot;B&quot; | &quot;tie&quot;&#10;  }},&#10;  &quot;confidence&quot;: &quot;high&quot; | &quot;medium&quot; | &quot;low&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rationale&quot;: &quot;&lt;100字以内的核心理由&gt;&quot;&#10;}}&quot;&quot;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">PAIRWISE_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"\"你是一个公正的评委。你的任务是比较两个 AI 助手对同一问题的回答，判断哪个更好。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【问题】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{question}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【回答 A】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{response_a}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【回答 B】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{response_b}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【评判维度】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1. 准确性：回答在事实上是否正确</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2. 完整性：是否充分回答了问题的所有方面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3. 清晰度：是否易于理解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">4. 有用性：是否切实帮助用户解决了问题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">请公正评判，不要被回答的长度或格式影响判断。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【输出格式】（JSON）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"winner\": \"A\" | \"B\" | \"tie\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"dimension_winner\": </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"accuracy\": \"A\" | \"B\" | \"tie\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"completeness\": \"A\" | \"B\" | \"tie\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"clarity\": \"A\" | \"B\" | \"tie\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"helpfulness\": \"A\" | \"B\" | \"tie\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  }}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"confidence\": \"high\" | \"medium\" | \"low\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"rationale\": \"&#x3C;100字以内的核心理由>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>构建 Elo 排名体系：</strong> 多次 pairwise 比较可以通过 Elo 算法转换为整体排名，这是 Chatbot Arena 使用的方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def update_elo(winner_elo: float, loser_elo: float,&#10;               k: float = 32) -&gt; tuple[float, float]:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;单次 pairwise 结果更新 Elo 分。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    expected_winner = 1 / (1 + 10 ** ((loser_elo - winner_elo) / 400))&#10;    expected_loser = 1 - expected_winner&#10;&#10;    new_winner_elo = winner_elo + k * (1 - expected_winner)&#10;    new_loser_elo = loser_elo + k * (0 - expected_loser)&#10;&#10;    return new_winner_elo, new_loser_elo\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update_elo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(winner_elo: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, loser_elo: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">               k: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> tuple[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"单次 pairwise 结果更新 Elo 分。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expected_winner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> **</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((loser_elo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> winner_elo) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expected_loser </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_winner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    new_winner_elo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> winner_elo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_winner)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    new_loser_elo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loser_elo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_loser)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_winner_elo, new_loser_elo</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"reference-guided-评分\">Reference-Guided 评分</h3><p>当有参考答案时，引导评委对照参考答案评判，可以大幅提高评委的一致性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"REFERENCE_GUIDED_PROMPT = &quot;&quot;&quot;你是一个精准的评测员。请对照参考答案，评判模型输出的质量。&#10;&#10;【问题】&#10;{question}&#10;&#10;【参考答案（标准答案）】&#10;{reference_answer}&#10;&#10;【模型输出】&#10;{model_output}&#10;&#10;【评判要求】&#10;1. 以参考答案为基准，识别模型输出中的正确点、遗漏点和错误点&#10;2. 遗漏关键信息扣分，添加参考答案中没有但正确的信息不扣分&#10;3. 事实性错误严重扣分&#10;&#10;【输出格式】（JSON）&#10;{{&#10;  &quot;score&quot;: &lt;0-10的整数&gt;,&#10;  &quot;correct_points&quot;: [&quot;正确点1&quot;, &quot;正确点2&quot;],&#10;  &quot;missing_points&quot;: [&quot;遗漏点1&quot;, &quot;遗漏点2&quot;],&#10;  &quot;errors&quot;: [&quot;错误点1&quot;],&#10;  &quot;summary&quot;: &quot;&lt;30字总结&gt;&quot;&#10;}}&quot;&quot;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REFERENCE_GUIDED_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"\"你是一个精准的评测员。请对照参考答案，评判模型输出的质量。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【问题】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{question}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【参考答案（标准答案）】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{reference_answer}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【模型输出】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{model_output}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【评判要求】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1. 以参考答案为基准，识别模型输出中的正确点、遗漏点和错误点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2. 遗漏关键信息扣分，添加参考答案中没有但正确的信息不扣分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3. 事实性错误严重扣分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">【输出格式】（JSON）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"score\": &#x3C;0-10的整数>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"correct_points\": [\"正确点1\", \"正确点2\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"missing_points\": [\"遗漏点1\", \"遗漏点2\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"errors\": [\"错误点1\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"summary\": \"&#x3C;30字总结>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"四类偏差及其校准\">四类偏差及其校准</h2><p>LLM 评委的最大风险不是&quot;无法评判&quot;，而是&quot;系统性地偏向某类输出&quot;而不被发现。四类主要偏差：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-位置偏差-position-bias\">1. 位置偏差（Position Bias）</h3><p>在 pairwise 比较中，评委倾向于偏好第一个出现的回答（primacy effect）或最后一个出现的回答（recency effect）。实验数据表明，仅仅交换 A 和 B 的顺序，有时会改变 10-20% 的评判结果。</p>\n<p><strong>校准方法：</strong> 对同一对比较进行两次评判，交换 A 和 B 的位置，只有当两次结果一致时才采用该评判；不一致时标记为&quot;无法确定&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def debiased_pairwise_eval(&#10;    judge_fn: callable,&#10;    question: str,&#10;    response_a: str,&#10;    response_b: str&#10;) -&gt; str:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;消除位置偏差的 pairwise 评测。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    # 第一次：A 在前&#10;    result_1 = judge_fn(question, response_a, response_b)&#10;    # 第二次：B 在前（交换位置）&#10;    result_2 = judge_fn(question, response_b, response_a)&#10;&#10;    # 将 result_2 的偏好反转以对齐原始顺序&#10;    inverted = {&quot;A&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;B&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;tie&quot;: &quot;tie&quot;}&#10;    result_2_aligned = inverted[result_2[&quot;winner&quot;]]&#10;&#10;    if result_1[&quot;winner&quot;] == result_2_aligned:&#10;        return result_1[&quot;winner&quot;]&#10;    else:&#10;        return &quot;inconsistent&quot;  # 不能给出可靠结论\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> debiased_pairwise_eval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    judge_fn: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">callable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    question: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response_a: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response_b: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"消除位置偏差的 pairwise 评测。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 第一次：A 在前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result_1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> judge_fn(question, response_a, response_b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 第二次：B 在前（交换位置）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result_2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> judge_fn(question, response_b, response_a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 将 result_2 的偏好反转以对齐原始顺序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inverted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tie\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tie\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result_2_aligned </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inverted[result_2[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"winner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result_1[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"winner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result_2_aligned:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result_1[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"winner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"inconsistent\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 不能给出可靠结论</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-冗长偏差-verbosity-bias\">2. 冗长偏差（Verbosity Bias）</h3><p>LLM 评委（尤其是 GPT-4）倾向于给出更长回答的模型更高分，即使长回答里包含的冗余信息没有实质帮助，甚至有混淆信息。</p>\n<p><strong>量化检测方法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def measure_verbosity_bias(&#10;    judge_fn: callable,&#10;    questions: list[str],&#10;    short_responses: list[str],&#10;    long_responses: list[str]  # 人工在 short 基础上加冗余内容&#10;) -&gt; float:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    测量评委的冗长偏差：&#10;    用相同内容的短版本和长版本（加了冗余内容）进行比较，&#10;    理想评委应该 tie，偏向长版本则是 verbosity bias。&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    long_wins = 0&#10;    for q, short, long in zip(questions, short_responses, long_responses):&#10;        result = judge_fn(q, short, long)&#10;        if result[&quot;winner&quot;] == &quot;B&quot;:  # B 是长版本&#10;            long_wins += 1&#10;&#10;    return long_wins / len(questions)  # 理想值接近 0.5，高于 0.7 则有显著偏差\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> measure_verbosity_bias</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    judge_fn: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">callable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    questions: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    short_responses: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    long_responses: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 人工在 short 基础上加冗余内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    测量评委的冗长偏差：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    用相同内容的短版本和长版本（加了冗余内容）进行比较，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    理想评委应该 tie，偏向长版本则是 verbosity bias。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    long_wins </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q, short, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">long</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(questions, short_responses, long_responses):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> judge_fn(q, short, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"winner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># B 是长版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            long_wins </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> long_wins </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(questions)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 理想值接近 0.5，高于 0.7 则有显著偏差</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>缓解策略：</strong> 在 rubric 中明确加入&quot;简洁性&quot;维度，并特别说明&quot;不应因篇幅更长而加分&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-自我增强偏差-self-enhancement-bias\">3. 自我增强偏差（Self-Enhancement Bias）</h3><p>当一个 LLM 评判与自己风格相似的输出时，会给出更高分。具体来说，GPT-4 作为评委时，对 GPT-4 生成的回答有系统性偏好；Claude 作为评委时，对 Claude 风格的回答有系统性偏好。</p>\n<p><strong>检测方法：</strong> 使用两个不同的 LLM 系列作为评委，如果它们对同一批比较给出的胜率有显著差异，且差异方向和评委来源相关，则存在自我增强偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>校准方法：</strong> 多评委集成（Multi-Judge Ensemble）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"4-格式偏差-format-bias\">4. 格式偏差（Format Bias）</h3><p>LLM 评委对有结构的输出（有标题、有列表、有代码块）给出更高分，即使内容质量相同。这一偏差在 2024 年被多个研究组独立确认。</p>\n<p><strong>缓解策略：</strong> 在 prompt 中加入明确说明：&quot;请不要因为使用了 Markdown 格式、列表或标题而给出更高评分，仅评判内容质量。&quot;</p>\n<h2 id=\"多评委集成-multi-judge-ensemble\">多评委集成（Multi-Judge Ensemble）</h2><p>单一 LLM 评委的可靠性有限，将多个评委的结果集成可以提高稳定性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from collections import Counter&#10;from typing import Literal&#10;&#10;JudgeVerdict = Literal[&quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;tie&quot;, &quot;inconsistent&quot;]&#10;&#10;def ensemble_judges(&#10;    judge_fns: list[callable],&#10;    question: str,&#10;    response_a: str,&#10;    response_b: str,&#10;    min_agreement: float = 0.6  # 需要至少 60% 的评委同意&#10;) -&gt; tuple[JudgeVerdict, float]:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    多评委集成，返回集成结论和置信度。&#10;&#10;    judge_fns 建议包含：GPT-4, Claude-3, Gemini-Pro 这类不同家族的评委&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    verdicts = []&#10;    for judge_fn in judge_fns:&#10;        result = judge_fn(question, response_a, response_b)&#10;        verdicts.append(result[&quot;winner&quot;])&#10;&#10;    counts = Counter(verdicts)&#10;    most_common, count = counts.most_common(1)[0]&#10;    agreement = count / len(judge_fns)&#10;&#10;    if agreement &gt;= min_agreement:&#10;        return most_common, agreement&#10;    else:&#10;        return &quot;inconsistent&quot;, agreement\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> collections </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Counter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Literal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">JudgeVerdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Literal[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tie\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inconsistent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ensemble_judges</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    judge_fns: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">callable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    question: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response_a: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response_b: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    min_agreement: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.6</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 需要至少 60% 的评委同意</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> tuple[JudgeVerdict, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    多评委集成，返回集成结论和置信度。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    judge_fns 建议包含：GPT-4, Claude-3, Gemini-Pro 这类不同家族的评委</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    verdicts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> judge_fn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> judge_fns:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> judge_fn(question, response_a, response_b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        verdicts.append(result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"winner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Counter(verdicts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    most_common, count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counts.most_common(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    agreement </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(judge_fns)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agreement </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_agreement:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> most_common, agreement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"inconsistent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, agreement</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"评委校准-对照人工标注\">评委校准：对照人工标注</h2><p>使用 LLM 评委之前，必须在一批有人工标注的样本上验证它与人类判断的相关性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from scipy.stats import spearmanr&#10;&#10;def calibrate_judge(&#10;    judge_fn: callable,&#10;    calibration_set: list[dict],  # [{&quot;question&quot;: ..., &quot;response&quot;: ..., &quot;human_score&quot;: ...}]&#10;) -&gt; dict:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    在人工标注集上校准 LLM 评委，计算相关性指标。&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    judge_scores = []&#10;    human_scores = []&#10;&#10;    for sample in calibration_set:&#10;        result = judge_fn(sample[&quot;question&quot;], sample[&quot;response&quot;])&#10;        judge_scores.append(result[&quot;score&quot;])&#10;        human_scores.append(sample[&quot;human_score&quot;])&#10;&#10;    # Spearman 相关系数（更鲁棒，对分数绝对值不敏感）&#10;    corr, p_value = spearmanr(judge_scores, human_scores)&#10;&#10;    # 加权 kappa（用于有序分类评分）&#10;    from sklearn.metrics import cohen_kappa_score&#10;    kappa = cohen_kappa_score(judge_scores, human_scores, weights=&#39;quadratic&#39;)&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &quot;spearman_corr&quot;: corr,&#10;        &quot;p_value&quot;: p_value,&#10;        &quot;cohen_kappa&quot;: kappa,&#10;        &quot;n_samples&quot;: len(calibration_set),&#10;        &quot;judge_acceptable&quot;: corr &gt;= 0.7 and kappa &gt;= 0.4  # 建议阈值&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy.stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spearmanr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calibrate_judge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    judge_fn: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">callable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    calibration_set: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># [{\"question\": ..., \"response\": ..., \"human_score\": ...}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    在人工标注集上校准 LLM 评委，计算相关性指标。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    judge_scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    human_scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sample </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calibration_set:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> judge_fn(sample[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"question\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], sample[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"response\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        judge_scores.append(result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        human_scores.append(sample[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"human_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Spearman 相关系数（更鲁棒，对分数绝对值不敏感）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    corr, p_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spearmanr(judge_scores, human_scores)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 加权 kappa（用于有序分类评分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohen_kappa_score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    kappa </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohen_kappa_score(judge_scores, human_scores, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quadratic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"spearman_corr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: corr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"p_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p_value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"cohen_kappa\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: kappa,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"n_samples\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(calibration_set),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"judge_acceptable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: corr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kappa </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.4</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 建议阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"llm-评委的实用检查清单\">LLM 评委的实用检查清单</h2><p>在生产环境使用 LLM 评委之前，检查以下项目：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"□ Rubric 是可操作的（避免&quot;好&quot;、&quot;优质&quot;等主观描述词）？&#10;□ 对位置偏差做了交叉测试（A↔B 互换后结果是否一致）？&#10;□ 在至少 100 个人工标注样本上验证了与人类判断的相关性（Spearman ≥ 0.7）？&#10;□ 使用了来自不同家族的多个评委（如同时用 GPT-4 和 Claude）？&#10;□ Prompt 中明确禁止了对格式和长度的偏好？&#10;□ 评委的分数分布是否合理（避免分数过度集中在 3-4 分）？&#10;□ 对高风险评测（影响生产决策的）有人工复核机制？\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>□ Rubric 是可操作的（避免\"好\"、\"优质\"等主观描述词）？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ 对位置偏差做了交叉测试（A↔B 互换后结果是否一致）？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ 在至少 100 个人工标注样本上验证了与人类判断的相关性（Spearman ≥ 0.7）？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ 使用了来自不同家族的多个评委（如同时用 GPT-4 和 Claude）？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ Prompt 中明确禁止了对格式和长度的偏好？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ 评委的分数分布是否合理（避免分数过度集中在 3-4 分）？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ 对高风险评测（影响生产决策的）有人工复核机制？</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LLM 作为评委有三种范式：Pointwise（打分）、Pairwise（比较）、Reference-Guided（对照参考）；选择取决于是否有绝对质量基准。</li>\n<li>四类系统性偏差：位置偏差、冗长偏差、自我增强偏差、格式偏差，每类都有具体的量化检测和缓解方法。</li>\n<li>位置偏差最容易缓解：对同一对比较交换顺序重新评判，两次不一致则标记为不确定。</li>\n<li>多评委集成（来自不同 LLM 家族）是提高可靠性的工程手段，建议设置 60% 以上一致度才采用结论。</li>\n<li>任何 LLM 评委在生产使用前必须在人工标注集上校准，验证 Spearman 相关系数和 Fleiss kappa 达到阈值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LLM 作为评委","id":"llm-作为评委"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种评委范式的详细设计","id":"三种评委范式的详细设计"},{"level":3,"text":"Pointwise 评分","id":"pointwise-评分"},{"level":3,"text":"Pairwise 比较","id":"pairwise-比较"},{"level":3,"text":"Reference-Guided 评分","id":"reference-guided-评分"},{"level":2,"text":"四类偏差及其校准","id":"四类偏差及其校准"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 位置偏差（Position Bias）","id":"1-位置偏差-position-bias"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 冗长偏差（Verbosity Bias）","id":"2-冗长偏差-verbosity-bias"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 自我增强偏差（Self-Enhancement Bias）","id":"3-自我增强偏差-self-enhancement-bias"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 格式偏差（Format Bias）","id":"4-格式偏差-format-bias"},{"level":2,"text":"多评委集成（Multi-Judge Ensemble）","id":"多评委集成-multi-judge-ensemble"},{"level":2,"text":"评委校准：对照人工标注","id":"评委校准-对照人工标注"},{"level":2,"text":"LLM 评委的实用检查清单","id":"llm-评委的实用检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自动化评测指标实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/llm-evaluation-benchmarks/methods/automated-metrics"},"next":{"title":"人工评测工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/llm-evaluation-benchmarks/methods/human-evaluation"}}